Searching for awards ceremony production in Malaga, Spain, usually means someone who has to hand out prizes in front of a room and wants it to look and sound right. A ceremony is a short event with a clear sequence: people are called, they walk up, they receive something and the room reacts. This page explains the audiovisual side of that sequence, what we supply from our own inventory, what we source and what we do not do.

Malaga Event Gear (MEG) supplies sound, microphones, lighting, a display and a technician for corporate events across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. We are not an event agency or a production company, so we do not write the script, host the evening or design the set. Our part sits within our [event technology service](/blog/event-technology-service/), where you can see the rest of what we offer.

