## Brief Overview

---

An awards ceremony needs three things from the audiovisual side: a voice that reaches the whole room, a stage that is lit so the winners can be seen and a screen that shows who is next. Malaga Event Gear supplies sound, microphones, stage lighting from our own inventory, a display and a technician who operates the sound and the microphones, from the [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) at 490 euros ex VAT for up to 120 guests. We supplied the lighting and the sound at the awards ceremony of the Billie Jean King Cup 2024 in Malaga. Confetti, fireworks, trophies, the host and the set are not ours.

## Key Highlights

---

-   Sound, microphones and stage lighting from our own inventory, with a technician who operates the sound and the microphones.
